{
 "id": "person-job-blues",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/person-job-blues",
 "offset_seconds": 0.11999999999974165,
 "words_heard": 243,
 "words": 249,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I had sons and I had daughters, I had cattle on the plain",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I was known in all the East and my barns were full of grain",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the messengers came running and they told me one by one",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fire and raiders and a great wind, and my children all were gone",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Naked I came from my mother's womb",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And naked I will return",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD gave, and the LORD has taken away",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed be the name of the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sores from my head down to my feet, I sat in ash and dust",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My friends said I must have sinned, for God is always just",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I cried into the silence and no answer came around",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Oh, that my words were written down",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I know that my Redeemer lives",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And in the end he will stand upon the dust",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet in my flesh I will see God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I myself will see him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My own eyes will behold him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the LORD answered Job out of the storm",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where were you when I laid the earth's foundation",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I put my hand upon my mouth, I'd talked of things too high",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I had heard of you by the hearing of the ear",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But now my eye has seen you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Naked I came from my mother's womb",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 6.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
